<title>HONG KONG: Kwong Sang Hong interim net rises 59 pct.</title>
<headline>Kwong Sang Hong interim net rises 59 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.9   vs 11.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0    vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    108.60 vs 68.28</p>
<p>    Turnover		     107.31 vs 171.84</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kwong Sang Hong International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 11-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Kwong Sang Hong is an investment holding and property development company. It is 50.14 pct-owned by Peregrine Investments Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
